## State

Run state is persisted in artifacts under the run workdir. Only `booping playbook-transition` writes it — never hand-edit an artifact's `status`.

Read the whole run's frontier before starting or resuming:

```
booping playbook-state fx-standalone-state --workdir <run workdir>
```

### State: item

- Referenced by: no graph scope — standalone, moved only by `--state item` calls
- Artifact: `items/{instance}.md` (relative to the run workdir)
- Initial status: `open`
- Advance: `booping playbook-transition fx-standalone-state <to> --state item --instance <slug> --workdir <run workdir>`

| Status | To | When | Gates |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `open` | `closed` | the item was closed | — |
| `closed` | *(terminal)* | — | — |

